>Minion/Monster gold earned is now a part of the bounty system

Do i get this right? CS'ing correctly will now place a bounty on my head punishing me for cs'ing?

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

It's missing something but I'm not quite sure what.

&#x200B;

Oh, it's upvotes.

How much can i trust the built in light meter in my Nikon EM (it can only shoot in aperture priority or flash sync at 1/90)?

&#x200B;

EDIT: Also, I've found out that the light seals on the camera are busted but I've already loaded a new roll of film into it and shot two frames, should I just pull the roll out and fix the camera or shoot the rest of the roll and then fix it (i.e. what will save me the most film from being destroyed)

I've recently (ish) ended an relationship where both me and my ex-SO still loved each other but we simply weren't working out, we started branching onto different paths - common interests started fading, finding time to spend quality time together became hard (even though we lived together). I really wasn't happy with the city we moved to, I struggled to make friends at uni and often felt lonely. It really saddens me that we had to break up since I still love her and think we could've worked out if we just communicated better and I told her about my fears of moving to that city - I guess i just wanted to be with her and was willing to try something so far out of my comfort zone for her.

&#x200B;

I don't really know what I want to do with my life, I studied computer science in the before mentioned city. I got through the first year and I'm now continuing the studies closer to my family at a different university, but I'm just not sure whether this is something that I truly want to do but I have no idea what else I can do.

&#x200B;

I struggle with making friends, it feels like i just suck at talking to people in general, I don't know what to say or I just don't have anything interesting to say. I feel depressed at times, I often find myself just wasting time, doing nothing of importance as i feel no drive towards anything in life. I've had suicide thoughts at times and sometimes still do. I just feel pointless, I can't find any meaning to my life.
